{"id":"5977","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5977_main_cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片的特征是新附加特征<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波涛状</span>。它不是积云的一个主要或突出特征，但它相当频繁地与积云同时出现。</p>\n<p>波涛状云是相对短寿命的波浪形，通常出现在云的上表面，呈弯曲状或碎波状。波涛状云通常称之为开尔文-亥姆霍兹波状云。</p>\n<p>在图片中可看到不同发展阶段的积云 – 从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>。没有单体发展成浓云部分，而对流活动在日落后不久停止。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">薄幕卷层云</span>的部分厚云纱是在地平线附近，在右上侧可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凝迹</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，阿斯彭代尔花园VIC 3195","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 23'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 7' 4'' E","date":"08 March 2016 1557 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.12"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5977_syn_cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>热干北风和南压过境的低压槽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5977_upper_cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>照片拍摄6小时后进行了探测，但比之前在当地时间10:15的探测更具代表性。</p>\n<p>探测显示出最下方72米3.8 °C的辐射冷却，以及到700 hPa的实际干绝热直减率。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5977_sat_cumulus-fractus-fluctus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>葵花卫星3号通道可见光卫星图像显示出向东发展的积云，和再往东的小积雨云单体。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局/日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}